    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451110/extras/8e357a02e2e5e43348d4d03c3bd3a3b1.poster.avif?t=1693550254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451110/extras/8e357a02e2e5e43348d4d03c3bd3a3b1.webm?t=1693550254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The undead have risen and seek to destroy your only remaining safe haven. <br>You play as the final Knight, the only surviving warrior willing to battle the hoards of undead warriors and defend his home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>End of Knights is an intense hack and slash survival game accompanied by an original Rock/Metal soundtrack. In this solo-developed game, You will experience challenging and intense gameplay focused on player mastery.<br><br>Enemies will attempt to destroy the walls that protect your stronghold. If they reach and destroy your stronghold or defeat you in battle... it's game over. <br><br>You will unlock and upgrade skills by completing challenges, these skills are kept between every new attempt you make to save your stronghold. <br><br>Collect Magic from defeated enemies and use it to slam protective Runes into the ground, fire powerful projectiles to decimate your enemies and cleave a path through the hoards with a lightning fast dash.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense arcade action. <br></li><li>22 increasingly challenging waves to survive.<br></li><li>6 unique enemy types.<br></li><li>4 powerful skills to unlock, upgrade and master.<br></li><li>19 challenges to complete.<br></li><li>A melodic Rock / Metal soundtrack.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451110/extras/8e357a02e2e5e43348d4d03c3bd3a3b1.poster.avif?t=1693550254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451110/extras/8e357a02e2e5e43348d4d03c3bd3a3b1.webm?t=1693550254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The undead have risen and seek to destroy your only remaining safe haven. <br>You play as the final Knight, the only surviving warrior willing to battle the hoards of undead warriors and defend his home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>End of Knights is an intense hack and slash survival game accompanied by an original Rock/Metal soundtrack. In this solo-developed game, You will experience challenging and intense gameplay focused on player mastery.<br><br>Enemies will attempt to destroy the walls that protect your stronghold. If they reach and destroy your stronghold or defeat you in battle... it's game over. <br><br>You will unlock and upgrade skills by completing challenges, these skills are kept between every new attempt you make to save your stronghold. <br><br>Collect Magic from defeated enemies and use it to slam protective Runes into the ground, fire powerful projectiles to decimate your enemies and cleave a path through the hoards with a lightning fast dash.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense arcade action. <br></li><li>22 increasingly challenging waves to survive.<br></li><li>6 unique enemy types.<br></li><li>4 powerful skills to unlock, upgrade and master.<br></li><li>19 challenges to complete.<br></li><li>A melodic Rock / Metal soundtrack.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Destroy unholy hoards of the undead and defend your stronghold! Gain new abilities and hone your skills in this challenging arcade action game. Can you survive the End of Knights?",
